Answer: Yes, the Iowa Farm Bureau Political Action Committee (PAC) officially endorsed Senator Joni Ernst prior to October 18, 2020, by designating her as a "Friend of Agriculture" for the 2020 general election. According to the source, this designation was decided and publicized early enough to be included in the "September 9... Iowa Farm Bureau Spokesman newspaper," confirming the endorsement occurred before October 18.

